    "application": "BambuStudio-02.05.00.66",
    "profile_title": "Hex Fidget Small carefully tuned 2 minimizing material waste",
    "profile_notes": "carefully tuned saving material waste and time. many many substantial value adding adjustments also that result in low filament material waist and quick print time with reasonably good strength… see the specifics below… 0.28mm layer, 1 walls, 1mm wall width, 0% infill, wall generator acrache, detect over hang walls off, detect narrow internal solid infill off, ensure vertical shell thickness disabled, acceleration speed [ short travel , initial layer travel, initial layer, outer wall, top surface ] all turned up to 10000mms. max volumetric speed for PLA, and PETG both set to 30mm3/s, cooling for over hangs set to 100%, minimum fan for layers less than 4 seconds 100% and for the other layer times 100% and auxiliary part cooling fan 70%. note that filament flow, and cooling settings will likely revert to default and acceleration speed will also likely revert to default if you use a different bambu printer.",
